From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:05:07 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(delegation): tell a subagent how to answer its parent
 mid-run

delegation.parent_reply_guidance (false = off): a subagent that holds the
agent_send tool gets one paragraph in its system prompt saying it can
answer its parent mid-run with agent_send(to="parent", ...), and each
steer sent through delegate_task(action="steer") repeats the hint. A
steered subagent otherwise only answers in its final summary.
