+### Answering the parent mid-run (opt-in)
+
+A steered subagent normally can only answer in its final summary. With
+`delegation.parent_reply_guidance: true`, a subagent that has the
+`agent_send` tool (a plugin tool such as hermes-device's `device-agents`) is
+told in its system prompt to call `agent_send(to="parent", text=...)` to answer
+mid-run, and each steer sent with `delegate_task(action="steer")` repeats the
+hint. The parent receives the answer with its next tool result, or as a new
+turn when its turn has ended.
+
